# Copy this file to .env.local (it is gitignored).
#
# No variables are required for mock mode.
# The mock API (cvmaker-ui/app/api/) is enabled automatically
# when you run `npm run dev`.
#
# To connect to the real .NET backend:
#   1. Remove the cvmaker-ui/app/api/ directory
#   2. Ensure CvMaker.Api is running on port 5133
#   3. See DEVELOPMENT.md for backend setup instructions
